  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes\n\n- An indexer getter read needs a setup with a configured return (#431, closes #429). A getter setup with only a Callback answered reads like a configured one: in Explicit mode it returned the default or stored value instead of throwing, and in Implicit mode it threw MissingImposterException once another criteria had a Returns. Now only Returns, Throws or UseBaseImplementation answers a read, as for methods and property getters.\n\n  Behaviour change: in Explicit mode, a read whose only matching setup has just a Callback now throws MissingImposterException, before the callback runs. Configure a Returns for the keys you read. In Implicit mode the callback runs and the read returns the stored or default value.",
